   "versionNonce": 1615442593,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• ADR-006 let anyone browse every page: unreviewed model judgements, their traces (prompts, raw answers), sources and transfers, gold labels with false-\n  accusation flags, and staff emails in the history.\n• A judgement says a sponsor did not report fully: public, it is an accusation. A model can misread a page, so a wrong one harms a sponsor and our\n  credibility.\n• The methodology should stay open: how we check (requirement sets, prompts, run settings) is what makes a result trustworthy.\n• Staff are people: their emails are personal data and nobody outside needs them.\n• ADR-001 proposed manual approval below 99% confidence; we have no calibrated confidence yet.\n• Revision 2026-11-22: transparency comes first. If our check decides the evidence is not enough, that is published as it is, with how far checks of its\n  kind can be trusted, not held back until a person agrees.",
   "originalText": "• ADR-006 let anyone browse every page: unreviewed model judgements, their traces (prompts, raw answers), sources and transfers, gold labels with false-\n  accusation flags, and staff emails in the history.\n• A judgement says a sponsor did not report fully: public, it is an accusation. A model can misread a page, so a wrong one harms a sponsor and our\n  credibility.\n• The methodology should stay open: how we check (requirement sets, prompts, run settings) is what makes a result trustworthy.\n• Staff are people: their emails are personal data and nobody outside needs them.\n• ADR-001 proposed manual approval below 99% confidence; we have no calibrated confidence yet.\n• Revision 2026-11-22: transparency comes first. If our check decides the evidence is not enough, that is published as it is, with how far checks of its\n  kind can be trusted, not held back until a person agrees.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "adr-context",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
