    }
   ],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "adr-optA-text",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 46,
   "y": 531.0,
   "width": 468,
   "height": 160.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1898149269,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1521113067,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A. Everything public, mark drafts\n\nHow it works: all pages stay open; unreviewed\njudgements carry a \"draft\" badge.\n\n+ nothing to build\n– a draft accusation is still public and indexed\n– traces and emails stay public",
   "originalText": "A. Everything public, mark drafts\n\nHow it works: all pages stay open; unreviewed\njudgements carry a \"draft\" badge.\n\n+ nothing to build\n– a draft accusation is still public and indexed\n– traces and emails stay public",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "adr-optA",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "adr-optB",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 550,
   "y": 525.0,
   "width": 480,
   "height": 332.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
   "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 1774749034,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 139355851,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "adr-optB-text"
    }
   ],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "adr-optB-text",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 556,
   "y": 531.0,
   "width": 468,
   "height": 320.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 287393588,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 770908984,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "B. Publish step and a staff view\n\nHow it works: checks.publication records what is\npublic; a withdrawn one stays public, marked.\nRevised 2026-11-22: a run publishes every\njudgement it made without an error, any label,\nwith how often judgements of its kind agreed\nwith gold labels (the share once ≥ 20 items, the\nbasis always). The public sees each published\njudgement with its whole trace; staff also see\nsources, gold, run tallies, costs and names.\n\n+ everything we decide is open, with its method\n+ a withdrawal can't hide a result\n– a misread page is a public accusation until\n  staff withdraw it",
   "originalText": "B. Publish step and a staff view\n\nHow it works: checks.publication records what is\npublic; a withdrawn one stays public, marked.\nRevised 2026-11-22: a run publishes every\njudgement it made without an error, any label,\nwith how often judgements of its kind agreed\nwith gold labels (the share once ≥ 20 items, the\nbasis always). The public sees each published\njudgement with its whole trace; staff also see\nsources, gold, run tallies, costs and names.\n\n+ everything we decide is open, with its method\n+ a withdrawal can't hide a result\n– a misread page is a public accusation until\n  staff withdraw it",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "adr-optB",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "adr-optC",
