   "versionNonce": 2105725222,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "what we chose and which criteria decided it",
   "originalText": "what we chose and which criteria decided it",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "adr-decision",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1243.0,
   "width": 1500,
   "height": 172.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
   "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 744069012,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 76363646,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "adr-decision-text"
    }
   ],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "adr-decision-text",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 46,
   "y": 1249.0,
   "width": 1488,
   "height": 160.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1115423877,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 800405834,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "We choose B, revised 2026-11-22 for transparency. Every judgement without an error is published by its run as it finishes, any label, however often its\nkind agreed with gold. A kind (model, prompt text, requirement set, label, quotes verified, asked again with every page, a question unanswered) is\ncompared with gold labels; the publication records the share once ≥ 20 items were compared, and its basis always (checks/publishing.py). Nobody publishes\nby hand. Staff may withdraw one with a reason (judgement.withdraw); it stays public, marked withdrawn with the reason. Public (view.published): published\njudgements with their whole trace (questions, pages read, prompt and message sent, raw answers, quote checks, rules), their runs, prompts, requirement\nsets and the files they quote, listed on the home page with filters. Staff only: the full trial and sponsor lists, judgements of running or failed checks,\nsources and transfers, gold, run tallies, costs, the workflow and names. Decided by openness over harm: gold agreement is shown with each result, not used\nas a gate.",
   "originalText": "We choose B, revised 2026-11-22 for transparency. Every judgement without an error is published by its run as it finishes, any label, however often its\nkind agreed with gold. A kind (model, prompt text, requirement set, label, quotes verified, asked again with every page, a question unanswered) is\ncompared with gold labels; the publication records the share once ≥ 20 items were compared, and its basis always (checks/publishing.py). Nobody publishes\nby hand. Staff may withdraw one with a reason (judgement.withdraw); it stays public, marked withdrawn with the reason. Public (view.published): published\njudgements with their whole trace (questions, pages read, prompt and message sent, raw answers, quote checks, rules), their runs, prompts, requirement\nsets and the files they quote, listed on the home page with filters. Staff only: the full trial and sponsor lists, judgements of running or failed checks,\nsources and transfers, gold, run tallies, costs, the workflow and names. Decided by openness over harm: gold agreement is shown with each result, not used\nas a gate.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "adr-decision",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
