   "updated": 1763726400000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Decided with the user on 2026-11-21: the public is anyone; the public sees verdict and quotes, not the trace; gold and sources are staff only; runs,\nprompts and history stay public. Then: approve by hand below 90% confidence, measured on gold; above it any label, accusations included, publishes by\nitself (replacing ADR-001's 99% proposal).\n\nRevised with the user on 2026-11-22: publish everything, even judgements whose kind disagrees with gold; show the public the whole trace; keep\nwithdraw, shown with its reason; drop /review. Replaced: the 90% gate, publishing by hand (judgement.publish), and hiding the trace from the public.",
   "originalText": "Decided with the user on 2026-11-21: the public is anyone; the public sees verdict and quotes, not the trace; gold and sources are staff only; runs,\nprompts and history stay public. Then: approve by hand below 90% confidence, measured on gold; above it any label, accusations included, publishes by\nitself (replacing ADR-001's 99% proposal).\n\nRevised with the user on 2026-11-22: publish everything, even judgements whose kind disagrees with gold; show the public the whole trace; keep\nwithdraw, shown with its reason; drop /review. Replaced: the 90% gate, publishing by hand (judgement.publish), and hiding the trace from the public.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "adr-notes",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
